  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Housing Credit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huskrediter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WV har ans&#xF6;kt om st&#xF6;d till finansiering av ett husl&#xE5;neprojekt, projektet &#xE4;r ett pilotprojekt med syftet att skapa f&#xF6;reningar i sm&#xE5; samh&#xE4;llen. Dessa kommer att vara ansvariga f&#xF6;r l&#xE5;n som skall anv&#xE4;ndas till husrenoveringar. Fyra samh&#xE4;llen i Republika Srpska, BiH har utsetts som pilotomr&#xE5;den.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WV has applied to Sida for financing of a Community Housing  Credit-project. The project is a pilot project and the aim is to create community associations, which will be responsible for loans to construction of houses for returnees and loans for renovation of houses (directed to people already living in the community). Four communities in Republika Srpska have been identified as pilot areas.</narrative>
  </description>
